WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:04.570
Um, so in short...

00:04.950 --> 00:06.950
Aishia is a spirit...

00:06.950 --> 00:10.480
...who relies on mana to live.

00:10.480 --> 00:12.530
She's forged a contract with me,

00:12.530 --> 00:15.410
and she receives mana
through a path with me...

00:15.410 --> 00:17.850
That may be true,

00:17.850 --> 00:20.920
but you can't just sleep together...

00:21.260 --> 00:24.090
You're bringing bad influence to the boy.

00:26.410 --> 00:27.550
Then...

00:27.550 --> 00:29.570
I'll sleep with Miharu.

00:30.050 --> 00:32.540
What? Me?

00:32.540 --> 00:34.790
It's not on par with Haruto,

00:34.790 --> 00:37.480
but Miharu's mana is so much...

00:37.930 --> 00:40.060
Miharu has mana?

00:40.060 --> 00:41.980
I don't really get it,

00:41.980 --> 00:44.090
but if I can help you, then sure.

00:45.370 --> 00:49.680
Since those two are going
to be in the same room,

00:49.680 --> 00:52.290
and you two are siblings,
Aki and Masato,

00:52.290 --> 00:53.870
so maybe you can sleep together?

00:54.240 --> 00:55.290
Fine by me.

00:55.290 --> 00:57.870
You'd better keep the room clean.

00:58.560 --> 01:01.370
Miharu and Aishia,
you can use this room.

01:02.010 --> 01:04.780
Aki and Masato,
you can use this one.

01:04.780 --> 01:05.840
Wow!

01:08.710 --> 01:11.840
Master Celia, please use this room.

01:12.870 --> 01:14.250
Okay.

01:14.250 --> 01:15.470
Goodnight.

01:15.840 --> 01:17.040
Goodnight.

01:41.000 --> 01:43.540
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

02:44.230 --> 02:47.060
Oh, I see... So that's how it is.

02:47.060 --> 02:48.860
Okay, I get it.

02:49.490 --> 02:52.150
I am Hiroaki Sakata.

02:54.700 --> 02:56.850
SHOPPING IN ANOTHER WORLD
Miharu Ayase...

02:56.850 --> 02:58.490
SHOPPING IN ANOTHER WORLD
I never thought I'd meet her in this world...

02:58.490 --> 03:00.030
I never thought I'd meet her in this world...

03:00.750 --> 03:05.790
I wonder what she would think if I said
I have memories of Haruto Amakawa?

03:06.230 --> 03:09.140
No, I'm no longer Haruto Amakawa.

03:09.140 --> 03:10.040
Right now...

03:10.550 --> 03:12.260
I'm living as Rio.

03:13.790 --> 03:15.050
I'm already...

03:15.630 --> 03:18.050
...determined to dirty my hands.

03:18.770 --> 03:21.430
To get my revenge against that man...

03:21.940 --> 03:25.060
Haruto Amakawa is already dead.

03:26.820 --> 03:28.570
Rio, are you awake?

03:28.570 --> 03:30.060
Master?

03:32.020 --> 03:34.010
Sorry to barge in at this house.

03:34.010 --> 03:36.530
I want to talk about something...

03:36.900 --> 03:38.720
Oh, I'm sorry.

03:38.720 --> 03:40.980
I should've been the one coming to you.

03:40.980 --> 03:42.820
Come inside.

03:44.130 --> 03:45.000
Thank you.

03:45.600 --> 03:48.860
It's really been a while since
we last had tea together.

03:48.860 --> 03:50.560
I suppose.

03:50.560 --> 03:51.420
Um...

03:52.230 --> 03:55.120
I couldn't ask you this
when everyone was around,

03:55.570 --> 03:58.430
but what were you doing
when we couldn't see each other?

03:58.860 --> 04:01.590
Where did you meet Aishia...

04:02.010 --> 04:06.240
Oh, never mind that!
What do you mean, past life?

04:06.240 --> 04:08.390
Master, please calm down.

04:09.520 --> 04:12.410
Oh, right... I shouldn't have...

04:13.880 --> 04:16.160
Let's get to it one by one.

04:16.160 --> 04:19.460
First, the topic I discussed
with the new people.

04:19.460 --> 04:21.410
About my past life...

04:21.770 --> 04:25.250
I have memories from my other self.

04:26.480 --> 04:30.770
And that self happened to live
in the same world as them.

04:31.250 --> 04:33.620
So that's why you could
speak their language.

04:33.620 --> 04:34.420
Yes.

04:35.270 --> 04:39.600
Do you remember
when I first met with you in Slum City?

04:40.030 --> 04:41.050
Of course.

04:41.860 --> 04:46.160
Right there, all the memories
of my past life came back to me.

04:46.910 --> 04:48.330
Is that so...

04:49.420 --> 04:51.620
I used to be Haruto.

04:51.620 --> 04:55.320
Oh, so that's why your
pseudonym is Haruto.

04:55.320 --> 04:57.880
I was twenty in my memories.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.890
Huh? So you're older than me!

05:01.740 --> 05:03.200
I guess so.

05:03.610 --> 05:08.700
No wonder you seemed oddly mature
when we first met...

05:10.570 --> 05:14.270
But, I'm Rio now, and I'm sixteen.

05:14.270 --> 05:17.090
Right, you are Rio.

05:17.090 --> 05:18.250
Yes.

05:18.250 --> 05:20.180
Thanks, Rio.

05:21.200 --> 05:25.710
Because you took me away,
we could be together like this...

05:25.710 --> 05:27.870
I'm feeling relieved deep inside.

05:29.030 --> 05:33.260
But I'm worried about my father.

05:33.260 --> 05:36.690
I'd love to at least tell him
that I'm safe and well.

05:36.690 --> 05:38.360
Right...

05:38.720 --> 05:41.290
Then, how about writing a letter?

05:41.290 --> 05:42.430
A letter...

05:42.430 --> 05:43.550
I guess so.

05:43.550 --> 05:46.560
Let's go to Ricca Guild
and buy some letterheads.

05:47.490 --> 05:49.270
That'll be delightful!

05:49.270 --> 05:52.240
Also, I have a proposal...

05:52.240 --> 05:53.690
Hm? What is it?

05:53.690 --> 05:57.890
You should use a pseudonym
to avoid being identified in Amande...

05:58.750 --> 05:59.730
BELTRUM KINGDOM, ROYAL CAPITAL BELTRANT

05:59.730 --> 06:01.510
BELTRUM KINGDOM, ROYAL CAPITAL BELTRANT
Princess Charles.

06:01.510 --> 06:04.240
This is quite a disaster to you.

06:04.730 --> 06:07.700
To think your fiancee would be kidnapped...

06:07.700 --> 06:11.220
Sir Reiss, you need not worry.

06:11.220 --> 06:12.890
The bandits have been dealt with.

06:13.490 --> 06:19.270
I received a report that they vanished
without a trace after Alfred's strike.

06:19.270 --> 06:20.280
Huh...

06:20.670 --> 06:23.810
It's just... I can't track Celia.

06:24.240 --> 06:26.280
They must have accomplices.

06:26.850 --> 06:29.930
We have sealed off the entire area
around the capital for the moment

06:29.930 --> 06:31.250
and sent in a search party.

06:31.250 --> 06:32.870
Is that so?

06:33.340 --> 06:38.540
That man and spirit must've
covered her tracks just like that...

06:38.540 --> 06:42.880
What a bold move indeed.
Impressive.

06:43.340 --> 06:47.890
Still, who would've thought the scripture's
prophecy would come true now...

06:48.410 --> 06:51.260
One of the Heroes has already
descended upon our nation,

06:51.260 --> 06:53.990
and Father seems to already
have him in his custody.

06:53.990 --> 06:58.900
I hope he may become
a dependable ally to Beltrum Kingdom.

06:58.900 --> 07:04.430
But isn't the kingdom supposed
to have another holy jewel?

07:04.850 --> 07:05.690
Yes.

07:06.140 --> 07:09.160
It's in Princess Flora
and Duke Huguenot's place.

07:09.840 --> 07:14.750
Perhaps they are about
to welcome the Hero now.

07:15.190 --> 07:18.150
Good grief, what trouble we have here.

07:18.150 --> 07:23.030
Even though he's a traitor
who's trying to side with Galarc...

07:23.450 --> 07:25.510
Speaking of Galarc Kingdom...

07:25.970 --> 07:31.360
Among the guest list, there was
one Liselotte Cretia from the Ricca Guild.

07:31.360 --> 07:33.520
She's quite the literary woman.

07:33.930 --> 07:37.980
Yes. Not to mention,
she's only fifteen.

07:38.410 --> 07:42.460
Well, well, the very existence
of Liselotte and Ricca Guild...

07:42.460 --> 07:46.820
...poses as much trouble
as Duke Huguenot.

07:46.820 --> 07:49.630
We must deal with them quickly.

07:50.120 --> 07:53.120
BELTRUM KINGDOM, RODANIA TERRITORY,
BELONGING TO MARQUESS RODAN

07:56.650 --> 08:00.180
Master Hero, would you care
for another drink?

08:00.730 --> 08:04.130
You said you're Roana?
Why don't you sit down?

08:04.490 --> 08:06.640
No, I...

08:06.640 --> 08:10.270
It pains me to make
a woman stand for so long.

08:13.010 --> 08:16.050
Thank you for your kindness.

08:16.570 --> 08:21.970
Well, I never thought we'd be able
to summon the legendary Hero here.

08:21.970 --> 08:24.150
It's truly an honour.

08:24.150 --> 08:28.170
Please let us know
if you need anything.

08:29.090 --> 08:31.570
The legendary Hero, eh...

08:32.990 --> 08:37.080
Yeah, it's kinda the popular stuff
on the novel website these days.

08:39.750 --> 08:40.220
READ 'N WRITE YOUR NOVELS

08:40.220 --> 08:41.710
READ 'N WRITE YOUR NOVELS
Yeah, yeah...

08:41.710 --> 08:43.920
So cliche...

09:00.480 --> 09:01.850
Who are you people?!

09:02.410 --> 09:03.900
Where am I?!

09:04.880 --> 09:05.860
Um...

09:06.660 --> 09:10.220
My name is Flora Beltrum.

09:10.220 --> 09:13.020
I'm the second princess
of the Beltrum Kingdom.

09:13.020 --> 09:17.970
I am the guardian of Princess Flora,

09:17.970 --> 09:20.290
Duke Gustav Huguenot.

09:20.890 --> 09:23.560
A princess and a duke?

09:23.560 --> 09:27.270
This is just like the prologue to
a "transition into another world" story!

09:27.670 --> 09:29.300
Could you be...

09:29.750 --> 09:33.110
...the Hero of our world?

09:33.110 --> 09:35.300
Hero? Me?

09:35.300 --> 09:37.200
Yes.

09:37.200 --> 09:39.750
According to the Six Wise Gods' prophecy,

09:39.750 --> 09:42.810
a thousand years after
the Holy Era begins,

09:42.810 --> 09:47.360
the Heroes will appear
before the holy stones.

09:47.360 --> 09:49.910
I'm a hero?

09:49.910 --> 09:54.210
Yes. I assume you are one,
judging from your sword...

09:54.210 --> 09:54.820
Sword?

09:57.790 --> 09:59.750
A katana?

10:00.230 --> 10:03.830
Gosh, this design reeks
of an edgy teenager!

10:04.620 --> 10:07.700
Oh, I see... So that's how it is.

10:07.700 --> 10:09.340
Okay, I get it.

10:09.890 --> 10:12.710
Man, this is quite the cheap stuff!

10:12.710 --> 10:15.850
I can speak to them using Japanese too.
This is too cliched!

10:16.270 --> 10:20.500
Master Hero, may I ask your name?

10:20.500 --> 10:22.750
Judging from this princess' behaviour,

10:22.750 --> 10:25.990
there's no mistaking that
the Hero has a high social status.

10:25.990 --> 10:27.420
Then...

10:28.990 --> 10:31.750
My name is Hiroaki Sakata.

10:33.260 --> 10:37.780
Still, I don't want to be treated like
a handyman if I behave modestly.

10:37.780 --> 10:41.790
If we're going to negotiate,
then I must appear higher.

10:42.320 --> 10:47.190
To be honest, I'm kinda bewildered here
if you suddenly call me a hero.

10:47.190 --> 10:52.210
So you summoned me here using
that holy jewel thingy, right, Princess?

10:52.210 --> 10:54.330
Yes, I suppose so.

10:54.330 --> 10:58.760
Since you could summon me here,
you could also make me go home, right?

10:58.760 --> 11:00.560
Huh? Go home?

11:00.560 --> 11:02.720
This is just kidnapping.

11:02.720 --> 11:08.160
I had a life in my own world,
yet you unreasonably took that away.

11:09.270 --> 11:14.570
I-I'm sorry, I was bewildered by
the sudden happening as well...

11:14.570 --> 11:20.220
Nah, it's not like I'm blaming you,
but I'm the one being troubled here, y'know?

11:20.220 --> 11:23.890
Lord Hero, aren't you being rude
toward Her Majesty the Princess?

11:23.890 --> 11:25.200
Stewart!

11:26.110 --> 11:27.920
I'm sorry...

11:27.920 --> 11:32.920
Forgive my foolish son, but you seem
to be mistaking this for a kidnapping.

11:33.430 --> 11:37.770
We swear we will tell you
about our situation for now.

11:38.160 --> 11:40.110
Would you care to listen?

11:41.140 --> 11:42.170
Fine.

11:45.630 --> 11:48.060
What a great day for some shopping!

11:51.070 --> 11:53.780
Take care of the house for us, you two.

11:53.780 --> 11:55.590
Be careful on the way.

11:56.300 --> 11:58.450
I've put a barrier around the house,

11:58.450 --> 12:01.060
but make sure to not leave the house.

12:01.450 --> 12:02.460
Okay!

12:04.320 --> 12:06.720
I'll carry Celia.

12:11.300 --> 12:12.350
Awesome!

12:12.350 --> 12:13.760
Wow!

12:13.760 --> 12:17.470
Well, will you allow me
to carry you, Miharu?

12:17.870 --> 12:18.590
O...

12:19.110 --> 12:21.010
Okay, then.

12:21.010 --> 12:23.350
Excuse me.

12:25.690 --> 12:27.670
Hang on tight.

12:27.670 --> 12:29.100
O-Okay.

12:33.010 --> 12:34.530
Wow...

12:35.070 --> 12:37.440
I'm really flying...

12:38.090 --> 12:41.190
I think you'll be able to enjoy the view.

12:41.670 --> 12:44.790
So pretty...
I've never seen anything like this.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.900
Aren't you afraid?

12:47.470 --> 12:50.980
I'm okay, as long as I'm with you...

12:54.080 --> 12:58.670
Hey... How much do you know Rio?

12:58.670 --> 13:00.340
Almost everything about him.

13:00.340 --> 13:04.430
Haruto's memories are flowing to me
through the contract's path.

13:04.820 --> 13:07.410
So you're sharing memories?

13:07.410 --> 13:08.300
Yes.

13:08.300 --> 13:13.810
Does that mean your memories
are strongly linked to each other?

13:13.810 --> 13:16.380
That's what a spirit contract is.

13:16.380 --> 13:19.890
We are connected spiritually
at the spirit level.

13:19.890 --> 13:21.980
Th-That sounds...

13:22.360 --> 13:23.850
...unfair...

13:24.490 --> 13:25.330
I mean...

13:25.970 --> 13:30.210
I just think you might know
the other side of Rio that I don't...

13:30.660 --> 13:33.350
It kind of feels lonely...

13:33.350 --> 13:35.710
The other side of Haruto you don't know...

13:36.460 --> 13:38.860
He's changed from what he used to be.

13:38.860 --> 13:41.790
He's able to rely on people, little by little.

13:42.580 --> 13:45.580
Is that so? That Rio...

13:45.580 --> 13:48.140
He must've met with wonderful people.

13:48.620 --> 13:50.140
All thanks to you.

13:50.140 --> 13:50.890
Hm?

13:51.220 --> 13:55.900
It was you who lit the path
first for him so gently.

13:56.490 --> 14:00.010
That's why he can confide in people now.

14:00.730 --> 14:02.020
I hope...

14:02.500 --> 14:05.420
...you'll be able to treat him
like you used to now.

14:06.640 --> 14:09.040
Yes, of course.

14:09.040 --> 14:11.040
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

14:14.430 --> 14:16.710
So that's the gist of it, Miharu.

14:16.710 --> 14:20.320
Please call Master Celia "Cecilia" in public.

14:20.320 --> 14:21.390
Okay.

14:21.390 --> 14:23.510
Also, before entering the city,

14:23.510 --> 14:25.290
let's change our hair colour.

14:25.970 --> 14:28.330
Black hair is rare here.

14:28.950 --> 14:30.470
Wow, amazing!

14:31.370 --> 14:33.190
Master, you too.

14:33.190 --> 14:36.610
There might be a search warrant
for you in the city.

14:39.230 --> 14:42.240
GALARC KINGDOM, TRADE CITY AMANDE

14:42.700 --> 14:46.990
It's as lively as rumoured.

14:47.660 --> 14:49.950
What are they lining up for?

14:49.950 --> 14:53.010
It's the local delicacy, menju.

14:53.010 --> 14:55.060
A manju, so to speak.

14:55.060 --> 14:56.650
Manju?

14:56.650 --> 15:00.490
In this Ricca Guild, there are a lot
of foods similar to those on Earth,

15:00.490 --> 15:03.470
including pasta, among many things.

15:03.990 --> 15:05.980
Let's go buy some on the way back.

15:05.980 --> 15:07.520
Okay, sure.

15:08.340 --> 15:09.470
Welcome!

15:10.460 --> 15:12.640
Welcome to Ricca Guild!

15:12.640 --> 15:17.560
I, Chloe, will be your attendant for today!

15:17.930 --> 15:19.890
Pleasure to have you here!

15:19.890 --> 15:22.930
I'm leaving them in your care, then.

15:22.930 --> 15:26.000
I'll be back here after an hour.

15:26.000 --> 15:28.530
Aishia, please be the interpreter for Miharu.

15:28.860 --> 15:29.950
Okay.

15:29.950 --> 15:33.000
Let's get ourselves
some clothes first, then!

15:33.330 --> 15:36.000
Please try on as many as you want!

15:36.000 --> 15:39.850
All right, we're going all out now!

15:51.890 --> 15:54.260
Miharu, got a minute?

15:54.260 --> 15:55.760
Cecilia?

15:56.690 --> 15:59.670
What do you think?
It's a sorceress' outfit.

15:59.670 --> 16:02.190
I think it looks so good on you!

16:02.190 --> 16:04.130
You should try this on for size!

16:04.130 --> 16:05.360
Me?

16:12.670 --> 16:14.960
Miharu, you look good in anything!

16:14.960 --> 16:16.310
Is that so?

16:16.310 --> 16:18.250
Yes! You look so cute!

16:23.750 --> 16:26.760
I couldn't get any valuable information...

16:27.100 --> 16:30.260
Well, it only happened yesterday.
I suppose it's only natural.

16:30.890 --> 16:34.070
Is there anything else you need?

16:34.070 --> 16:36.580
We could use some letterheads.

16:36.580 --> 16:38.930
I'll take you there!

16:38.930 --> 16:40.880
I'll be going for a while.

16:40.880 --> 16:43.150
Miharu, feel free to look around.

16:52.270 --> 16:55.620
Miharu, have you found
anything you want...

16:55.620 --> 16:56.500
Wha...

16:57.730 --> 16:58.620
Ah!

16:58.620 --> 16:59.760
Oh!

16:59.760 --> 17:01.920
Um, I'm sorry...

17:01.920 --> 17:03.270
What's wrong?

17:03.270 --> 17:04.400
Nothing.

17:04.400 --> 17:06.400
It's nothing...

17:06.400 --> 17:07.770
Um, Miharu...

17:08.170 --> 17:11.390
Don't mind me, just take your time.

17:11.390 --> 17:13.670
Mister Haruto, wait!

17:14.850 --> 17:19.350
Mister Haruto, can you
try this on over your body?

17:19.350 --> 17:20.850
O-Okay.

17:21.990 --> 17:25.230
I knew it! It looks so good on you!

17:25.230 --> 17:27.040
You think so?

17:27.040 --> 17:29.150
Yes, it does.

17:29.700 --> 17:31.840
Miharu, you're good at picking clothes.

17:31.840 --> 17:33.660
It looks so great on you, Mister!

17:34.190 --> 17:36.880
Miharu, thank you.

17:36.880 --> 17:39.390
I could use more casual outfits too.

17:39.790 --> 17:41.580
I'll have this one, then.

17:42.140 --> 17:44.640
Thank you for your purchase!

17:44.640 --> 17:48.590
By the way, we're launching
a campaign for men's clothes now.

17:49.100 --> 17:53.340
If you buy another item, you can get
a discount for a set of two items.

17:53.340 --> 17:54.670
How about it?

17:54.670 --> 17:56.670
That's Ricca Guild for you.

17:56.670 --> 17:58.750
Always so good at marketing.

17:58.750 --> 17:59.530
All right...

17:59.530 --> 18:02.690
Can I pick this time?

18:02.690 --> 18:03.600
Sure.

18:03.600 --> 18:05.310
BELTRUM KINGDOM ROYAL CAPITAL

18:05.310 --> 18:06.400
STATE GUEST HOUSE
Lady Liselotte.

18:07.260 --> 18:11.680
Seems like it'll be a while
until the border closing is lifted.

18:12.230 --> 18:14.140
Got it, Aria.

18:14.620 --> 18:19.830
I guess Beltrum would want
to control information with this.

18:20.260 --> 18:22.720
Thanks to this,
I'm not getting any work.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.790
And I'm stranded here.

18:25.220 --> 18:29.330
You should forget about work at this point,
and consider it leisure time.

18:29.330 --> 18:30.800
Leisure, huh...

18:31.350 --> 18:35.300
Well, Duke Arbor's men
totally getting wrecked...

18:35.740 --> 18:38.880
...is quite the entertainment to Galarc...

18:38.880 --> 18:41.310
I mean, quite helpful.

18:41.730 --> 18:45.020
But the news about
the bride Celia is a shame.

18:45.020 --> 18:46.810
She's your old friend, right?

18:50.180 --> 18:52.380
Who do you think did it?

18:53.460 --> 18:56.260
Must be someone against Duke Arbor.

18:56.260 --> 18:57.780
I suppose so...

18:58.170 --> 19:02.750
Still, amid this chaos, I never thought
the Hero would descend too...

19:03.360 --> 19:06.310
It seems the hot topic within the castle.

19:06.310 --> 19:11.760
Maybe in Galarc,
we can actually summon a Hero too!

19:13.230 --> 19:14.890
I gotta go back soon...

19:18.590 --> 19:22.770
Master Celia and Miharu chose your clothes.

19:23.570 --> 19:25.690
I'm sure you have your preferences,

19:25.690 --> 19:28.190
but I'll be happy if you like them.

19:34.360 --> 19:35.620
I'll go with this!

19:35.620 --> 19:36.530
Me too!

19:37.890 --> 19:39.990
Wow, this is so cool!

19:40.430 --> 19:43.500
This is cute! Thanks!

19:43.910 --> 19:46.000
Those look good on you two.

19:46.590 --> 19:48.000
Unfortunately,

19:48.410 --> 19:50.880
I can't find any detailed information...

19:50.880 --> 19:53.420
...regarding Satsuki and Takahisa.

19:53.870 --> 19:55.590
I see...

19:55.590 --> 20:01.470
But, it seems certain that the Hero
has descended, just like the prophecy.

20:02.220 --> 20:07.350
The theory that you got involved
in the summoning would make sense.

20:08.080 --> 20:10.090
This is just my speculation,

20:10.550 --> 20:12.710
but I think Satsuki and Takahisa...

20:12.710 --> 20:16.360
They got summoned to this world as heroes.

20:16.850 --> 20:18.090
Heroes?

20:18.090 --> 20:21.370
Heroes, as in the MC of a game?

20:21.820 --> 20:25.730
According to the prophecy,
there should be six heroes.

20:25.730 --> 20:28.370
They may be two of them.

20:28.710 --> 20:32.140
Sis Satsuki and Bro are heroes...

20:32.140 --> 20:36.670
If he's here in this world,
I want to look for him!

20:36.670 --> 20:38.840
I get where you're coming from,

20:39.230 --> 20:44.970
but I think you should learn about
this world's language and knowledge first.

20:45.410 --> 20:47.850
I see... I guess so.

20:48.270 --> 20:52.620
Understood.
We can't just keep relying on Aishia.

20:53.090 --> 20:55.210
So we have to study?

20:55.210 --> 20:59.780
Man, we came to another world,
but nothing changes with what we do...

21:00.230 --> 21:03.790
So, about our next step...

21:03.790 --> 21:07.200
I have trustworthy friends,

21:07.200 --> 21:09.490
so I think I'll consult with them.

21:09.490 --> 21:11.950
Trustworthy friends?

21:11.950 --> 21:13.790
The spirit people.

21:14.400 --> 21:16.430
I'm hungry...

21:16.430 --> 21:18.660
Let's eat now, then.

21:18.660 --> 21:21.500
I'll help out, if you like.

21:21.500 --> 21:23.150
Thank you.

21:23.150 --> 21:25.430
Let's have Japanese food tonight.

21:25.430 --> 21:28.020
Japanese? Yay!

21:28.020 --> 21:29.350
Japanese food?

21:29.350 --> 21:32.650
It's the food in their previous world.

21:32.650 --> 21:34.400
I can't wait for that.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.860
How's it going?

21:38.900 --> 21:41.630
It's a bit too thin...

21:41.630 --> 21:43.910
Let's add more miso, then.

21:44.340 --> 21:48.060
I thought Sis Miharu
couldn't handle guys...

21:48.460 --> 21:50.820
But it's okay if it's Mister Haruto, huh...

21:51.750 --> 21:55.040
I'd like to be able to cook too.

21:55.790 --> 21:57.890
Would you like to try?

21:57.890 --> 21:58.550
Sure!

22:07.310 --> 22:08.990
Let's eat!

